Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 12:08:07 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] [ROCm][Kimi-K3] Support MoRIIO consumers with specialized
 decode

Allow the built-in MoRIIO consumer in READ and WRITE modes. Reuse the existing transfer completion guarantees, and keep other connectors and producer-side specialized execution unsupported. Add configuration coverage and document the supported deployment.

Signed-off-by: Yichao Zhu <Yichao.Zhu@amd.com>
(cherry picked from commit e34bf5f4784569ca3c2381312f2e7e4d512434de)
